=BA=BFu ti=E1=BA=BFp nh=E1=BA=ADn.</p>
<p><strong>=C4=90=E1=BB=83:</strong> X=C3=A1c =C4=91=E1=BB=8Bnh ch=C3=ADnh =
x=C3=A1c h=C3=A0m l=C6=B0=E1=BB=A3ng v=C3=A0ng (tu=E1=BB=95i v=C3=A0ng) v=
=C3=A0 c=C3=A1c kim lo=E1=BA=A1i =C4=91i k=C3=A8m, l=C3=A0m c=C4=83n c=E1=
