=E1=BA=ACN (ACCEPTANCE CRITERIA - AC)</strong></h2>
<p><strong>AC 1: =C4=90o ph=E1=BB=95</strong></p>
<ul>
 <li data-uuid=3D"814fd341-c02c-47bf-8995-8d6b173bc8eb">
  <p><strong>Given:</strong> Nh=C3=A2n vi=C3=AAn =C4=91o ph=E1=BB=95 m=E1=
=BB=9F phi=E1=BA=BFu ti=E1=BA=BFp nh=E1=BA=ADn, H=E1=BB=87 th=E1=BB=91ng hi=
